This repository contains a sysl binding and nothing else. Cairo itself is not
vendored here -- it is a library the machine already has, linked with
`@link("cairo")` -- so its terms are not reproduced below. Cairo is dual
licensed under the LGPL 2.1 and the MPL 1.1; see https://www.cairographics.org/.

